# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# LaTeX build artefacts
# Regenerated on every compile. The .tex, .bib, .bbl, .cls, .bst and the built
# .pdf stay tracked -- co-authors download the PDF straight from this repo.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
*.aux
*.log
*.out
*.fls
*.fdb_latexmk
*.synctex.gz
*.synctex(busy)
*.blg
*.suppinfo
*.toc
*.lof
*.lot
*.bcf
*.run.xml
*.nav
*.snm
*.vrb
*.xdv

# LaTeX editor / tool backups
*.bak
*.tmp
*~

# Inkscape autosaves, e.g. Figure_FreeSwimming.svg.2026_04_30_13_51_30.0.svg
*.svg.[0-9]*.svg

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Python
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.venv/
venv/
env/
.ipynb_checkpoints/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Compiled binaries
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
a.out
*.o
*.so

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# OS cruft
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Project-specific
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Ca2+ heatmap figure sources: the .svg is >200 MB, well over GitHub's 100 MB limit.
# Matched by name rather than by path -- the previous path-pinned rule silently
# stopped applying when the file was moved into FigureMakingFiles/.
SupplementartFig_Ca2Heatmaps.*
Manuscript/abstracts/Abstract_ZebrafishCircuits2026.md
